WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.295 --> 00:00:16.896
led the children through a park of tall trees and green lawns.

2
00:00:18.157 --> 00:00:20.217
They passed fountains and statues.

3
00:00:21.578 --> 00:00:24.199
Women in long, full dresses strolled by.

4
00:00:25.659 --> 00:00:28.540
Men in top hats and long coats accompanied them.

5
00:00:29.936 --> 00:00:33.958
"All the men seem to like hats," remarked Vinnie.

6
00:00:35.039 --> 00:00:37.540
Florence looked at Vinnie strangely again.

7
00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:40.382
"What game are they playing?"

8
00:00:41.623 --> 00:00:45.925
Mandy asked, pointing to a group of young men and women.

9
00:00:47.306 --> 00:00:50.408
Each held a stick with a round wooden head on the end.

10
00:00:51.688 --> 00:00:58.092
The sticks looked like big hammers and the players used them to hit balls through hoops.

11
00:00:59.464 --> 00:01:02.205
"That's croquet," explained Florence.

12
00:01:03.545 --> 00:01:05.886
"People love to play games in Hyde Park."

13
00:01:07.306 --> 00:01:10.727
Mandy stopped suddenly and let out a loud gasp.

14
00:01:12.088 --> 00:01:14.568
They stood in front of a large glass building.

15
00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:18.049
Many people were walking through the doors.

16
00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:21.851
"Wow!" cried Mandy.

17
00:01:21.871 --> 00:01:26.452
"This is the Crystal Palace," explained Florence.

18
00:01:27.572 --> 00:01:29.873
"The Great Exhibition is inside."

19
00:01:31.194 --> 00:01:33.455
They followed the crowd into the building.

20
00:01:34.736 --> 00:01:37.678
Mandy covered her mouth in shock.

21
00:01:38.818 --> 00:01:42.400
The sunlight shone through the glass roof onto many exhibits.

22
00:01:42.420 --> 00:01:48.383
"Whoa!" Vinnie cried, glancing from side to side.

23
00:01:49.504 --> 00:01:54.907
The Crystal Palace was divided into areas, and each had a special theme.

24
00:01:56.207 --> 00:02:00.417
In one area, the children saw different kinds of machines.

25
00:02:01.758 --> 00:02:05.260
In another, women gathered around collections of jewelry.

26
00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:10.403
"There are over 13,000 exhibits," said Florence.

27
00:02:11.643 --> 00:02:19.728
Vinnie saw all kinds of things on display: art, tools, kitchen devices, and even animals.

28
00:02:19.748 --> 00:02:25.631
"I can see why Charlotte wanted to come here," said Mandy.

29
00:02:26.731 --> 00:02:27.472
She looked up.

30
00:02:28.708 --> 00:02:33.210
Above an amazed crowd, a man walked on a tightrope.

31
00:02:34.511 --> 00:02:35.651
"What's that?"

32
00:02:36.411 --> 00:02:37.152
Vinnie cried.

33
00:02:38.272 --> 00:02:42.154
He ran over to a tall structure with a marble statue inside.

34
00:02:43.374 --> 00:02:45.595
A big crowd was gathered around it.

35
00:02:45.615 --> 00:02:52.658
"The statue in this iron structure is―," said a man wearing a top hat.

36
00:02:54.059 --> 00:02:56.680
"Shakespeare!" Vinnie shouted.

37
00:02:57.952 --> 00:02:59.553
"The young man is right!"

38
00:03:00.133 --> 00:03:00.993
shouted the man.

39
00:03:01.013 --> 00:03:05.755
"This is indeed England's own William Shakespeare."

40
00:03:07.256 --> 00:03:09.457
Mandy and Florence caught up with Vinnie.

41
00:03:09.477 --> 00:03:15.339
"Queen Victoria's husband, Prince Albert, is the one who planned the exhibition.

42
00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.700
It just opened in May.

43
00:03:18.901 --> 00:03:23.763
The Crystal Palace was built in only nine months," said Florence.

44
00:03:23.783 --> 00:03:29.153
"Florence, where do you think Charlotte is?"

45
00:03:30.373 --> 00:03:31.153
asked Mandy.

46
00:03:31.173 --> 00:03:34.154
"Miss Charlotte loves music.

47
00:03:35.274 --> 00:03:39.955
I heard they have the world's largest organ here," replied Florence.

48
00:03:41.256 --> 00:03:44.016
She stopped to speak to a man who had a map.

49
00:03:44.036 --> 00:03:49.598
"This way, Miss Mandy and Master Vinnie," called Florence.

50
00:03:50.818 --> 00:03:52.479
The children followed Florence.

51
00:03:53.799 --> 00:03:57.020
They passed exhibits from countries in Asia and Europe.

52
00:03:58.228 --> 00:04:02.531
"It feels like we're in a giant shopping mall," said Mandy.

53
00:04:04.072 --> 00:04:06.974
They reached an area where an orchestra was playing.

54
00:04:06.994 --> 00:04:12.058
"I don't see her anywhere," said Florence, worried.

55
00:04:13.299 --> 00:04:15.020
The children looked around too.

56
00:04:16.261 --> 00:04:20.084
But they did not see anyone wearing a pink dress like Mandy's.
